sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant LendingController
    participant BookModel
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Request to Lend Book
    Frontend->>LendingController: POST /lendings {book_id, return_date}
    LendingController->>Database: Verify user role and status
    Database-->>LendingController: Status OK
    LendingController->>BookModel: Check availability
    BookModel->>Database: Query available copies
    Database-->>BookModel: Copies > 0
    BookModel-->>LendingController: Book Available
    LendingController->>Database: Create Lending Record
    Database-->>LendingController: Success
    LendingController->>BookModel: Decrement available copies
    BookModel->>Database: Update Book
    Database-->>BookModel: Updated
    LendingController-->>Frontend: Success Response (200 OK)
    Frontend-->>User: Display Success Message
